    "description": "<p>When you resolve a set with <strong>Magic Cards</strong>, if it includes a <strong>joker</strong> and/or a <strong>7</strong>, you deal <strong>【SL】</strong> extra damage until the start of your next turn; if it includes a <strong>joker</strong> and/or a <strong>1</strong>, all damage you suffer is reduced by <strong>【SL 】</strong> until the start of your next turn (before Affinities); if it doesn't include any <strong>joker</strong>, <strong>1</strong>, or <strong>7</strong>, you recover <strong>【SL × 2】</strong> Hit Points.</p><hr><p><strong>You Gain:</strong> @EFFECT[pfu-high-or-low-damage] and/or @EFFECT[pfu-high-or-low-reduction] or @GAIN[&amp;sl(\"high-or-low\")*2 hp]{SL × 2 HP}</p>",
